{"about_the_game":"This is a virtual multi-dimensional VR world. You can choose your own characters and equipment to take risks with your partners in the multi-dimensional world.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou can participate in the battle of the end of the day. Can you find the portal to go home from the end of the zombie infested world?<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou can also guard the home core. The monster kingdom is sending troops to attack the game core and recruiting adventurers to guard it.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou can also give full play to your creativity on your own island and build your own seaside villa.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe ordinary difficulty of the game is suitable for normal games. After the game is over, it will be rated and rewarded according to the combat performance.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWhen you have advanced weapons, you can challenge the nightmare difficulty and get more game coins.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe game has a harsh death mechanism. If you die, your character will be reset and all the previously obtained game coins will be lost. Therefore, you must protect yourself when the game is out. If you can't hold on to the game, you can send it home at any time.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1160770?t=1654648844","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1160770/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1654648844","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1160770/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1654648844","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1160770/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1654648844","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Tracked Controller Support","id":52},{"description":"VR Only","id":54},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,2,5],"notes":"The game map has scenes where weapons are used to fight zombies or monsters."},"detailed_description":"This is a virtual multi-dimensional VR world. You can choose your own characters and equipment to take risks with your partners in the multi-dimensional world.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou can participate in the battle of the end of the day. Can you find the portal to go home from the end of the zombie infested world?<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou can also guard the home core. The monster kingdom is sending troops to attack the game core and recruiting adventurers to guard it.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou can also give full play to your creativity on your own island and build your own seaside villa.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe ordinary difficulty of the game is suitable for normal games. After the game is over, it will be rated and rewarded according to the combat performance.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWhen you have advanced weapons, you can challenge the nightmare difficulty and get more game coins.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe game has a harsh death mechanism. If you die, your character will be reset and all the previously obtained game coins will be lost. Therefore, you must protect yourself when the game is out. If you can't hold on to the game, you can send it home at any time.","developers":["\u81ea\u5728\u5929"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1160770/header.jpg?t=1654648844","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1160770/412580/10be6d4a0d5a7f138d5b03f8add81d50023f8584/1751197226/dash_av1.mpd?t=1635777604","dash_h264":"https